<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0"><style><fill><fillColor color="rgb(250,245,240)"/></fill></style><data><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="34" width="864" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="30" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>第三步 · 推演：写出各自的反应函数</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="102" width="520" height="30"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>厂商 1 的利润＝（价格 − 成本）× 产量</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="134" width="520" height="54"><content textType="body" fontSize="28" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[\pi_1=\left[a-b\left(q_1+q_2\right)-c\right]q_1]]></latex></formula></p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="200" width="520" height="30"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>对自己的产量 <formula><latex><![CDATA[q_1]]></latex></formula> 求导，并令导数为零</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="232" width="520" height="48"><content textType="body" fontSize="28" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[a-c-2bq_1-bq_2=0]]></latex></formula></p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="296" width="520" height="30"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>解出厂商 1 的反应函数</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="328" width="520" height="56"><content textType="body" fontSize="28" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[q_1=\frac{a-c-bq_2}{2b}]]></latex></formula></p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="396" width="520" height="56"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>厂商 2 同理，只需把下标 1、2 对调。</p></content></shape><line startX="580" startY="104" endX="580" endY="404"><border color="rgb(214,200,194)" width="2"/></line><shape type="text" topLeftX="608" topLeftY="100" width="304" height="100"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>读法一：对手每多生产 1 单位，我就少生产半个单位。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="608" topLeftY="206" width="304" height="140"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>读法二：它还不是答案。它说的是——“如果对手生产这么多，我最好生产那么多”。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="608" topLeftY="348" width="304" height="70"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(210,90,86)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>两家的最优反应要同时成立，才叫均衡。</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="14"><p><!-- citation: [3] --></p><p>推导只有三步：写利润，对产量求导，解出自己的产量。</p><p>得到的关系叫反应函数，它把“我的最优产量”写成“对手产量”的函数。</p><p>提醒学生：反应函数不是均衡，它只是半张答卷；均衡要等下一页两家的反应函数相交。</p></content></note></slide>